<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Tradehold to unbundle, delist from JSE.</title>
<headline>Tradehold to unbundle, delist from JSE.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stores group Tradehold Ltd said on Tuesday it planned to unbundle the company and delist from the Johannesburg Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The aim was to eliminate the discount at which its shares traded compared to the market value of the firm's underlying investment in Shoprite Holdings Ltd, it said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
